A boba shop that seems abandoned.
Call out?
- Yes
	audio "res://sound/sfx/wormcall.wav"
	[wait time="2.0"]
	if {skunkOpen} == true:
		set {bearOpen} = true
		Bear: Ah, seeing you help out around town inspired me to make some extra boba.
		Bear: ... sorry if I was unresponsive, got into the grove of it and I'm known to get too focused.
		label help
		- I can help hand it out to everyone.
			Bear: Perfect! That’s exactly why I like having you around.\
			Let’s make sure everyone gets some.
			set {bearKey} = true
			[end_timeline]
		- I'll drink it all. | [if {bearOptionalResponse1} == false] [else="hide"]
			Bear: Hey! That’s not the point… maybe just one for you.
			set {bearOptionalResponse1} = true
		- Do you want me to just put it on the counter? | [if {bearOptionalResponse2} == false]
			Bear: Hmm… I guess. But it’s more fun if you hand it out.
			set {bearOptionalResponse2} = true
		jump help
	else:
		...
		No response
- No
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]